# Copy to .env and fill in what you have. Everything is optional — with
# nothing set, SafeRemit runs on mock CAMARA data + a deterministic
# rationale (the "cached demo data" fallback the Tooling Guide recommends).
#
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# --- Nokia Network-as-Code (CAMARA APIs) ---
# Get this from networkascode.nokia.io: subscribe to SIM Swap, Number
# Verification, Device Status and Location Verification, then copy the
# x-rapidapi-key shown on your app / the API "Endpoints" tab.
# Setting this switches all four clients from mock to live calls.
NAC_API_KEY=
# Override only if your portal shows a different host than the default:
# NAC_API_HOST=network-as-code.p-eu.rapidapi.com
# CAMARA_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=6

# --- Google AI Studio / Gemini (rationale rewriting) ---
# Free key from aistudio.google.com. Without it the rationale uses the
# deterministic template (fine for a live demo).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
